From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: spark site <site@local>
Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 09:30:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] site: open a turn for a trailing system message or one before an assistant turn

Ported from vllm-project/vllm PR #62459. The fork's render_message opened the
assistant header only for a mid-conversation system message; a system-only
request, or a system message followed by an assistant history turn, ended the
prompt at the system role and generation stopped or continued the system text.
---
 vllm/tokenizers/deepseek_v41_encoding.py | 14 ++++++++++++--
 1 file changed, 12 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/vllm/tokenizers/deepseek_v41_encoding.py b/vllm/tokenizers/deepseek_v41_encoding.py
--- a/vllm/tokenizers/deepseek_v41_encoding.py
+++ b/vllm/tokenizers/deepseek_v41_encoding.py
@@ -705,7 +705,14 @@
             )
             prompt += task_sp_token
 
-    elif role == "user" or (role == "system" and index > 0):
+    elif role == "user" or (
+        role == "system"
+        and (
+            index > 0
+            or index == len(messages) - 1
+            or messages[index + 1].get("role") == "assistant"
+        )
+    ):
         # Normal generation: append Assistant + thinking token
         # (mid-conversation system messages also trigger the assistant header)
         prompt += ASSISTANT_SP_TOKEN
-- 
